OL,3,AIsrael says it has destroyed major
OL,4,Aunderground Hezbollah base
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's military says it has destroyed
OL,7,Fa large underground complex operated by
OL,8,FHezbollah in southern Lebanon.
OL,10,FIt said it used more than 1,000 tonnes
OL,11,Fof explosives to destroy two tunnels
OL,12,Fspanning more than 2km (1.2 miles)
OL,13,Fbeneath the Ali Taher Ridge.
OL,15,FThe blast triggered seismic activity
OL,16,Fequivalent to a magnitude 4.1
OL,17,Fearthquake, according to the US
OL,18,FGeological Survey.
OL,20,FThere was no immediate public response
OL,21,Ffrom Hezbollah or the Lebanese
OL,22,Fgovernment.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
